# Recorded API fixtures are transcripts, not source.
#
# Prettier reindents `spellbook-variants-sample.json` from 1-space to 2-space,
# which is ~5,600 lines of diff with identical content — and it came back every
# time anyone ran `pnpm format`, so it landed in unrelated commits and made
# every merge involving it a conflict. Two agents hit it on the same day. A
# fixture's job is to be byte-for-byte what the API returned; reformatting it
# serves nobody and quietly weakens that claim.
